@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@merchantA = demo-merchant-a
@merchantProductId = 101
@customerId = 301
@orderId = 1

### 准备商家商品：应用启动后执行 scripts/merchant-demo.sql

### 管理员创建客户：独立 CRUD 演示；下单账号使用脚本预置的客户 301/302
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/customer/create
Authorization: Bearer demo-platform-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "options": {"requestId": "commerce-customer-create-1"},
  "payload": {
    "displayName": "Ada Lovelace",
    "email": "ada@example.com"
  }
}

### 下单：可信客户身份确定 customerId，数据库商品确定 merchantId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/action/create
Authorization: Bearer demo-customer-a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payload": {
    "items": [
      {"merchantProductId": {{merchantProductId}}, "quantity": 2}
    ]
  }
}

### 查询订单值字段：orderId 取下单响应 data.orderIds 中的一项；默认不加载结构属性
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": {{orderId}}}

### 同一详情接口显式展开客户和成交明细，不重新读取当前商品
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":{{orderId}},"options":{"expandRelations":["customer","orderItemList"]}}

### 默认订单创建未授权
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/create
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload": {"customerId": {{customerId}}}}

### 取消本人订单：只允许 CREATED → CANCELLED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/order/action/cancel
Authorization: Bearer demo-customer-a
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload":{"orderId":{{orderId}}}}

### 公共商品：不带凭证，只查已启用商品与白名单字段
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/merchantProduct/list
Content-Type: application/json

{}
